  "abstract_summary": "Systematic literature reviews are slow and hard to reproduce, because screening and knowledge extraction are manual and rarely documented. Large language model (LLM) survey generators speed up the work, but their reasoning and citations are hard to audit, and deep research agents add fluent-yet-unfaithful synthesis...",
